<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>PlateSafe — Eat Confidently</title>
<meta name="description" content="PlateSafe helps you find restaurants that take safety, food quality, and allergy awareness seriously.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,500;1,9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --cream: #FAF6EE;
    --cream-2: #F1E9D8;
    --forest: #1F3B34;
    --forest-2: #16241F;
    --sage: #7E9884;
    --sage-tint: #E4EAE1;
    --coral: #E0603F;
    --coral-dark: #C24C31;
    --line: rgba(22,36,31,0.12);
    --max: 1120px;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html{ scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body{
    margin:0;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--forest-2);
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  img,svg{ display:block; max-width:100%; }
  a{ color: inherit; }

  .wrap{ max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }

  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--forest);
  }

  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--forest);
    opacity: 0.72;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:6px; height:6px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background: var(--coral);
    flex-shrink:0;
  }

  /* NAV */
  header{
    position: sticky; top:0; z-index: 20;
    background: rgba(250,246,238,0.86);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav.wrap{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding-top: 18px; padding-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .logo{
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--forest);
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px;
    text-decoration:none;
  }
  .logo .mark{ width:22px; height:22px; }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    text-decoration:none;
    border: 1.5px solid transparent;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background .18s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background: var(--coral);
    color: #FFF8F2;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{ background: var(--coral-dark); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-ghost{
    border-color: var(--line);
    color: var(--forest);
    background: transparent;
    padding: 10px 20px;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color: var(--forest); }
  .btn-sm{ padding: 9px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; }

  /* HERO */
  .hero{
    padding: 76px 0 64px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 58px);
    line-height: 1.06;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--coral);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .hero p.lead{
    font-size: 18px;
    color: rgba(22,36,31,0.72);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 20px 0 30px;
  }

  form.signup{
    display:flex;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: 440px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .field{
    flex:1;
    min-width: 220px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 4px 4px 4px 20px;
    transition: border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .field:focus-within{ border-color: var(--forest); }
  .field input{
    border:0; outline:0; background:transparent;
    font-family:'Inter'; font-size: 14.5px;
    padding: 10px 4px;
    width:100%;
    color: var(--forest-2);
  }
  .field input::placeholder{ color: rgba(22,36,31,0.4); }

  .microcopy{
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(22,36,31,0.55);
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .form-msg{
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 12px;
    display:none;
  }
  .form-msg.show{ display:block; }
  .form-msg.ok{ color: var(--forest); }

  /* SEAL */
  .seal-wrap{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .seal{
    width: min(320px, 78vw);
    animation: stampIn .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1) both;
    animation-delay: .15s;
  }
  @keyframes stampIn{
    0%{ opacity:0; transform: scale(1.35) rotate(-14deg); }
    60%{ opacity:1; }
    100%{ opacity:1; transform: scale(1) rotate(-6deg); }
  }
  .seal-brand-text{ font-family:'Inter'; font-weight:700; font-size: 15.5px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; }
  .seal-slogan-text{ font-family:'Inter'; font-weight:600; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 1.3px; opacity: 0.85; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .seal{ animation: none; transform: rotate(-6deg); }
  }

  /* SECTION shared */
  section{ padding: 64px 0; }
  .section-head{ max-width: 620px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .section-head h2{ font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 38px); margin-top: 14px; line-height:1.15; }
  .section-head p{ color: rgba(22,36,31,0.68); font-size: 16.5px; margin-top: 14px; }

  /* FEATURES */
  .features{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .feature{
    background: var(--cream-2);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 30px 26px 32px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(22,36,31,0.06);
    transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
    display:block;
    text-decoration:none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .feature:hover{ transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px -18px rgba(22,36,31,0.35); border-color: rgba(22,36,31,0.14); }
  .feature:hover .farrow{ transform: translateX(3px); opacity:1; }
  .feature .ficon{
    width: 44px; height:44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--forest);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .feature .ficon svg{ width:22px; height:22px; }
  .feature h3{
    font-size: 19px; margin-bottom: 8px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  }
  .feature .farrow{
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--coral);
    opacity: .65;
    transition: transform .18s ease, opacity .18s ease;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .feature p{ font-size: 14.8px; color: rgba(22,36,31,0.68); margin:0; }

  /* HOW IT WORKS */
  .how{ background: var(--forest); border-radius: 28px; color: var(--cream); }
  .how .wrap{ padding: 64px 28px; }
  .how .section-head h2{ color: var(--cream); }
  .how .section-head p{ color: rgba(250,246,238,0.72); }
  .steps{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    counter-reset: step;
  }
  .step{ position: relative; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1.5px solid rgba(250,246,238,0.22); }
  .step .num{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--coral);
    display:block;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .step h3{ color: var(--cream); font-size: 18.5px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .step p{ color: rgba(250,246,238,0.68); font-size: 14.5px; margin:0; }

  /* WHY */
  .why{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .why-stat{
    background: var(--cream-2);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 36px 30px;
  }
  .why-stat .big{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 46px;
    color: var(--coral);
    line-height:1;
  }
  .why-stat p{ margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14.5px; color: rgba(22,36,31,0.68); }
  .why-copy p{ font-size: 16.5px; color: rgba(22,36,31,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .why-copy p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }

  /* FINAL CTA */
  .cta-final{
    text-align:center;
    background: var(--cream-2);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 68px 28px;
  }
  .cta-final h2{ font-size: clamp(28px,4vw,42px); }
  .cta-final p{ color: rgba(22,36,31,0.68); font-size: 16.5px; margin: 14px auto 30px; max-width: 460px; }
  .cta-final form.signup{ margin: 0 auto; justify-content:center; }

  footer{ border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 34px 0; }
  footer .wrap{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px;
  }
  footer .flinks{ display:flex; gap:20px; font-size: 13.5px; color: rgba(22,36,31,0.6); text-decoration:none; }
  footer .flinks a{ text-decoration:none; }
  footer .flinks a:hover{ color: var(--forest); }
  footer .fcopy{ font-size: 13.5px; color: rgba(22,36,31,0.5); }

  @media (max-width: 880px){
    .hero{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 44px; }
    .hero .seal-wrap{ order:-1; }
    .seal{ width: 220px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .features{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .steps{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .why{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    section{ padding: 44px 0; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav class="wrap">
    <a class="logo" href="#top">
      <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" stroke="#1F3B34" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M7 12.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="#E0603F" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      PlateSafe
    </a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="#signup2">Join the waitlist</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main id="top">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Launching soon</span>
      <h1>Know before you go — <em>who's actually keeping the kitchen safe.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">PlateSafe pairs verified hygiene checks with real diner reports on allergy handling and food quality, so you can pick a restaurant with confidence instead of guesswork.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="seal-wrap">
      <svg class="seal" viewBox="0 0 240 240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <defs>
          <path id="topArc" d="M 72,100 A 52,52 0 0 1 168,100"/>
          <path id="bottomArc" d="M 68,148 A 58,58 0 0 0 172,148"/>
        </defs>
        <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="112" fill="var(--cream-2)"/>
        <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="98" fill="none" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.55"/>
        <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="78" fill="var(--forest)"/>
        <text class="seal-brand-text" fill="var(--cream)">
          <textPath href="#topArc" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">PLATESAFE</textPath>
        </text>
        <text class="seal-slogan-text" fill="var(--cream)">
          <textPath href="#bottomArc" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">SAFE TO EAT</textPath>
        </text>
        <path d="M92,120 L112,142 L152,96" stroke="var(--coral)" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="features">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What you'll see on every listing</span>
      <h2>Three things Google reviews don't tell you.</h2>
      <p>Star ratings mix up bad service with real safety issues. We separate them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
      <a class="feature" href="allergies-preferences.html">
        <div class="ficon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.5-9.5-9C1 8 2.5 4.5 6 4c2-.3 3.6.6 4.5 2 .9-1.4 2.5-2.3 4.5-2 3.5.5 5 4 3.5 8-2.5 4.5-6.5 9-6.5 9z" stroke="#FAF6EE" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 10l1.6 1.6L15 8" stroke="#E0603F" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Your allergies and preferences <span class="farrow">→</span></h3>
        <p>Allergen handling, cross-contact risk, and menu transparency — flagged clearly, before you book a table, not after you're seated.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="feature" href="diner-reports.html">
        <div class="ficon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 20l1.2-3.6A8 8 0 1112 20a7.9 7.9 0 01-4-1.1L4 20z" stroke="#FAF6EE" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Real diner reports <span class="farrow">→</span></h3>
        <p>Written by families, carers, and people managing real conditions — not just anonymous star ratings from anyone who walked in.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="feature" href="verified-allergen-compliance.html">
        <div class="ficon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4.6-3 8.4-7 9-4-.6-7-4.4-7-9V6l7-3z" stroke="#FAF6EE" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Verified allergen compliance <span class="farrow">→</span></h3>
        <p>Structured allergen compliance checks and public reporting, so you can see who's actually walking the talk — not just who has the best photos.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="how">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--cream); opacity:.8;">How it works</span>
          <h2>From search to seated, without the second-guessing.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <span class="num">01</span>
            <h3>Search your area</h3>
            <p>Filter by cuisine, and by the allergy or safety concerns that matter to your household.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="num">02</span>
            <h3>Check the seal</h3>
            <p>See the verification status, the last check date, and what it actually covered.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="num">03</span>
            <h3>Book with confidence</h3>
            <p>Read reports from diners with similar needs, then reserve straight from the listing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="why">
      <div class="why-stat">
        <span class="big">1 in 13</span>
        <p>children in the US are estimated to live with a food allergy — roughly two in every classroom. Most restaurant menus still don't say how seriously that's taken.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why we're building this</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:14px; font-size: clamp(24px,3vw,32px);">Because "we can accommodate that" shouldn't be a guess.</h2>
        <p>Right now, finding out whether a kitchen takes food safety seriously means calling ahead, hoping the server actually knows, and finding out for sure only after you've ordered.</p>
        <p>PlateSafe puts that information up front — verified, dated, and written in plain language — so eating out is one less thing to worry about.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-final" id="signup2">
      <span class="eyebrow">Be first to know</span>
      <h2>Help shape a safer way to eat out.</h2>
      <p>Join the waitlist and we'll bring PlateSafe to your city as soon as we're ready to launch there.</p>
      <form class="signup" name="waitlist" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="waitlist">
        <div class="field">
          <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Join the waitlist</button>
      </form>
      <p class="form-msg">You're on the list — we'll email you the moment PlateSafe opens up.</p>
      <p class="microcopy">No spam. Just a heads-up when we launch in your area.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="fcopy">© <span id="year"></span> PlateSafe Pty Ltd</span>
    <nav class="flinks">
      <a href="#">Privacy</a>
      <a href="#">Terms</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>

<!-- Hidden static form so Netlify's build bots detect this form at deploy time -->
<form name="waitlist" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" hidden>
  <input type="email" name="email" />
  <input name="bot-field" />
</form>

<script>
  document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

  document.querySelectorAll('form.signup').forEach(function(form){
    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      // Let Netlify handle the actual submission (native form POST).
      // This just gives instant feedback in the UI.
      var msg = form.parentElement.querySelector('.form-msg');
      if (msg) {
        setTimeout(function(){
          msg.classList.add('show');
        }, 50);
      }
    });
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
